{"seq":5,"slug":"systematic-design","title":"系统性设计方法","stage":"DONE","category":"design-thinking","chapterCount":4,"docCount":13,"url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 系统性设计方法 简介\n\n系统性设计方法关注的是如何在组织层面构建和管理设计能力，使设计从个人技能提升为团队和组织的核心竞争力。随着企业对用户体验重视程度的不断提升，设计团队面临着从项目交付到战略贡献、从手工作坊到规模化运营的转型挑战。掌握系统性的设计管理方法，是设计领导者的必备能力。\n\n本知识库面向设计管理者、设计负责人以及希望理解设计在组织中如何发挥更大价值的学习者，无论你是正在组建设计团队的创业者、推动设计转型的管理者，还是希望理解设计战略的产品负责人，都能在这里找到系统的方法论支撑。\n\n全书共分为三章，从设计的战略定位出发，深入到设计运营的日常管理，最终聚焦于设计价值的量化证明。\n\n第一章**设计战略**探讨如何将设计提升到战略层面，涵盖战略性设计思维的方法、设计愿景的构建以及通过竞品设计分析发现差异化机会，帮助你建立设计与商业目标之间的战略联系。\n\n第二章**设计运营**聚焦设计团队的高效运作，涵盖设计系统的治理方法、设计流程的持续优化、设计团队的扩展策略以及设计工具生态的构建，帮助你打造一支高效协作、持续输出优质设计的团队。\n\n第三章**衡量设计影响**讲解如何量化设计对业务的贡献，涵盖设计度量指标的选择、设计投资回报的计算方法以及设计成熟度模型的运用，帮助你用数据和事实证明设计投入的价值。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章建立设计战略思维，再通过第二章掌握设计运营的具体方法，最后通过第三章学会用数据说话证明设计价值。建议结合自身组织的实际情况进行学习和反思，将方法论落地到具体的管理实践中。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-strategy","title":"设计战略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-design-thinking","title":"战略性设计思维","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-strategy/strategic-design-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-vision","title":"设计愿景与北极星","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-strategy/design-vision"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-design-analysis","title":"竞品设计分析","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-strategy/competitive-design-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-ops","title":"设计运营","docCount":4,"url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-ops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-system-governance","title":"设计系统治理","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-ops/design-system-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-process-optimization","title":"设计流程优化","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-ops/design-process-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-team-scaling","title":"设计团队扩展","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-ops/design-team-scaling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-tools-ecosystem","title":"设计工具生态","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-ops/design-tools-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-measurement","title":"设计度量","docCount":3,"url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"measuring-design-impact","title":"设计影响力度量","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-measurement/measuring-design-impact"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-maturity-model","title":"设计成熟度模型","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-measurement/design-maturity-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-quality-assurance","title":"设计质量保障体系","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/design-measurement/design-quality-assurance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"measuring-design-impact","title":"衡量设计影响","docCount":3,"url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/measuring-design-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-metrics","title":"设计度量","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/measuring-design-impact/design-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"roi-of-design","title":"设计投资回报","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/measuring-design-impact/roi-of-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-maturity-model","title":"设计成熟度模型","url":"/h/design-thinking/systematic-design/measuring-design-impact/design-maturity-model"}]}]}